+## 0.20.4-wip
+ * `NumberFormat.parse` returns `double.nan` for NaN, instead of `0.0 / 0.0`,
+   which AOT compilers fold on the build host's CPU. This makes AOT builds of
+   apps that parse numbers independent of the build host's CPU.
+
